<title>AFGHANISTAN: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>AFGHANISTAN GOVERNMENT LIST (970613)</p>
<p> **************************************************************</p>
<p> * NOTE: The Taleban Islamic Movement of Afghanistan, which   *</p>
<p> *	 captured Kabul on September 27, has installed an     *</p>
<p> *	 acting government, which answers to Taleban leader   *</p>
<p> *	 and head of state Mullah Mohammad Omar, known as     *</p>
<p> *	 Amir al-Momineen (Commander of the Faithful).	  *</p>
<p> **************************************************************</p>
<p>Head of State, or Amir al-Momineen</p>
<p>(Leader of the Faithful)...Mullah Mohammed OMAR Mujahid**</p>
<p>							  (**SEE NOTE ABOVE)</p>
<p>				    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>INTERIM RULING COUNCIL</p>
<p>Chairman of interim ruling council &amp;</p>
<p>	Deputy leader of Taleban ........Mullah Mohammad RABBANI</p>
<p>				    - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Chief Justice (acting).............Mullah Abdul Sattar SANANI</p>
<p> Education (acting)...............Mullah Sayed Ghiasuddin AGHA</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs.............Mullah Abdul JALIL</p>
<p>Military Chief of Staff.Mullah Mohammad HASSAN</p>
<p> Head of Army Corps.......Mullah Mohammad FAZIL</p>
<p> Head of Customs Dept........Mullah Abdul RAZAQ</p>
<p>Interior (acting)..Mullah Khairullah KHAIRKHWA</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS: (ACTING):</p>
<p> Agriculture..............Mullah Mohammad NASIM</p>
<p> Commerce.......Hafez MUHEBULLAH</p>
<p> Communications............ Mullah Mohammad DAD</p>
<p> Construction................Name not yet known</p>
<p> Defence.......Mullah OBAIDULLAH</p>
<p> Education.........Mullah Sayed Ghiasuddin AGHA</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs.............Mullah Abdul JALIL</p>
<p>Frontier Affairs.....Maulwi Jalaluddin HAQQANI</p>
<p> Higher Education ............Maulawi HAMDULLAH</p>
<p>Information &amp; Culture..Mullah Amir Khan MUTAQI</p>
<p> Interior...........Mullah Khairullah KHAIRKHWA</p>
<p> Justice............Mullah Nuruddin Turabi QARI</p>
<p> Mines &amp; Industries...........Maulawi Ahmad JAN</p>
<p> Planning ..........Din MOHAMMAD</p>
<p> Public Health ...........Mullah Mohammed ABBAS</p>
<p> Water &amp; Power..............Mullah Mohammad ESA</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>GOVERNORS: (acting)</p>
<p> Herat Province ............Mullah Abdul RAZZAQ</p>
<p>Kabul Mayor..Mullah Abdul MAJID</p>
<p> Kabul Province.......Mullah Abdul Manan NIAZAI</p>
<p> Nangarhar Province .........Maulwi Abdul KABIR</p>
<p> Paktia Province .............Maulwi SHAMSUDDIN</p>
