<p>			     - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>DEPARTMENT HEADS (acting)</p>
<p> Academy of Sciences............Mullah MUSTASED</p>
<p>Intelligence....Qari AHMADULLAH</p>
<p>Labour &amp; Social Affairs....Maulwi Mohammad MIR</p>
<p> Light Industries........Maulwi Hamdullah ZAHED</p>
<p> Olympic Committee...........Name not yet known</p>
<p> Pilgrimage &amp; Religious Works......Maulwi Abdul Shukur HAQQANI</p>
<p>Promoting Virtue &amp; Preventing Vice....Maulwi Samiullah MUAZIN</p>
